  "description": "Makes me emotional having written the name of this project down in a Markdown file in summer 2021, and only coming to do it in summer 2026. Oh how far we've come since then. With the significant lack of Munros being done by myself so far this year, I keep surprising myself with my raw pace from sea level, when doing a west coast Munro. 1:59:59 to the first summit, hell yeah. The race of the heart to this pace, along with Brothers In Arms Live from Nîmes, and having both summits to myself, made this much-anticipated one extra special. Finally bagging The Seafood Shack in Ullapool was also a delicious way to top off the day.",
